<title>USA: Cycle-Sat completes digital installations.</title>
<headline>Cycle-Sat completes digital installations.</headline>
<dateline>FOREST CITY, Iowa 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cycle-Sat Inc said Wednesday it completed its fifth and final successful digital MPEG 2 encoder installation in Detroit.</p>
<p>Over the last 45 days, the company has installed additional digital systems in its sales and service centers in New York, Chicago and Burbank.</p>
<p>&quot;The digital network and equipment will allow Cycle-Sat to enjoy multiple and simultaneous digital transmissions from our various locations,&quot; said vice president Ted Henry.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
